          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ te Dee-bid nyuurä kam thiekni da̱ŋ rɛw. Kä cu ram in yien kɔt wi̱i̱ thi̱ek pa̱ny, kä min cɛ waŋdɛ kap nhial, cuɛ ram mi riŋ kä rɔa nɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu yien ɛ la̱r kuäär. Kä cu kuäär wee i̱, “Mi ɛ jɛn kä rɔa tekɛ thok mi Jäl kɛ jɛ.” Kä cuɛ ben thiekä kɛ wuɔ̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu yieen radɔ̱diɛn nɛn ri̱i̱ŋɛ. Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Tekɛ radɔ̱diɛn mia̱a̱ ri̱i̱ŋni kä rɔa!” Kä cu kuäär wee i̱, “No̱o̱ŋɛ ni thok bä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu yieen wee i̱, “Ɛn ram in ri̱i̱ŋ kɛ nhiam, ce̱t wuɔ̱rɛ kɛ wuɔ̱ɔ̱r Ä-ɣi-madh gat Dha-dok.” Kä cu kuäär wee i̱, “Ɛ ram mi gɔaa, la no̱o̱ŋɛ ni thuk ti gɔw.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-ɣi-madh kuäär cɔl wee i̱, “Cikɛ gɔw kɛn diaal.” Kä cuɛ rɔ goŋ nhiam kua̱r luthä wee i̱, “Ɛ puɔ̱th tekɛ Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu, min ci ji̱ kän kä nɛy tin ca rɔ jiɛc kɛ kui̱du kuäärä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär wee i̱, “Gɔaaɛ kɛ ŋuɛ̈t ni Ɛ̈b-ca-lom?” Kä cu Ä-ɣi-madh ɛ loc i̱, “Min jäk raan kɔaru ni Yo-ab ɣä, cä nɛy ti ŋuan ti ca rɔ̱ dol nɛn, kua̱ jɛ lɛ kui̱c ɛ kui̱ ŋukä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär wee i̱, “Wër wa̱nɛ mɔ cuŋni thi̱n.” Cuɛ wä thi̱n kä cuɛ cuɔ̱ŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛn ɛ, cu raan Kuc ben. Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Thuk ti gɔw kɛ kui̱ kua̱rä! Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial ji̱ kän ɛn walɛ kä nɛy diaal tin ca rɔ̱ jiɛc kɛ kui̱du.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär Kuc jiök i̱, “Gɔaaɛ kɛ ŋuɛ̈t ni Ɛ̈b-ca-lom?” Kä cu Kuc ɛ loc i̱, “Dëë nhɔk ni mi ci ji̱ tɛ̈r kua̱rä, kɛnɛ nɛy diaal tin ci rɔ̱ jiɛc kɛ kui̱du min ci tuɔ̱k kä jɛ tuɔ̱k kä kɛn diaal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär lɔcdɛ jiath ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kä cuɛ wä duëël nhial min te wi̱i̱ thiek, kä cuɛ wiee. Kä min wee kɛ cuɛ wee i̱, “Aɣ gatdä ni Ɛ̈b-ca-lom, ni Ɛ̈b-ca-lom! Dëë nhɔk ni mi ci li̱w ni ɣän kɛ gua̱a̱thdu, lö gatdä ni Ɛ̈b-ca-lom, gatdä, gatdä!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
